1
00:00:16,699 --> 00:00:23,250
The bedsheets burn and cling like heavy lead

2
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:31,329
A fevered ghost upon an unmade bed

3
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:38,710
My lungs are dry, they crack like winter wood

4
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:48,200
Trapped in a cold that's never understood

5
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:58,859
Ginger, your silhouette is drifting through the haze

6
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:06,950
A scarlet flash that sets the dark ablaze

7
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:15,269
I reach out blind to touch your crimson dress

8
00:01:16,430 --> 00:01:22,670
My trembling hands catch only emptiness

9
00:01:23,849 --> 00:01:29,790
The ticking clock distorts the room in slow decay

10
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:38,629
I lose the count of every passing day

11
00:01:40,569 --> 00:01:46,420
The scent of jasmine cuts across the air

12
00:01:49,129 --> 00:01:55,519
A phantom memory of you standing there

13
00:01:58,569 --> 00:02:05,719
That slow and haunting rumba plays inside my head

14
00:02:06,849 --> 00:02:13,659
The shadows dance where living men should tread

15
00:02:15,270 --> 00:02:22,379
Did you abandon me for being weak and blind?

16
00:02:24,969 --> 00:02:31,039
Or is it just the fever in my mind?

17
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:11,990
The mirror shows a stranger pale and thin

18
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:19,219
A hollow shell where life has withered in

19
00:03:22,530 --> 00:03:29,370
I feel the urge to close my eyes and yield

20
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:36,879
To leave my broken body on the field

21
00:03:39,250 --> 00:03:45,599
I tear the sheets, I break the fever’s chain

22
00:03:47,490 --> 00:03:53,340
No frozen lock will keep me in this pain

23
00:03:56,199 --> 00:04:02,060
The sleeping lion rises from the floor

24
00:04:04,330 --> 00:04:10,180
And drags his body toward the bedroom door